# Files uploaded to Vercel but never used by the deployed site.
#
# The deployment is static: `vercel.json` points at `web/`, which already contains
# the frontend and every precomputed result. Nothing is built on Vercel, so the
# engine sources, the test suites and the raw market data are dead weight in the
# upload — data/sample alone is 8.7 MB against a 2.4 MB site.
#
# Excluded here, not from git: the repository still carries all of it, because
# regenerating `web/` needs the engine and the CSVs. This only trims what travels
# to Vercel.

# Engine and tests
src/
include/
tests/
third_party/
CMakeLists.txt
cmake-build-*/

# Raw market data. Results derived from it live in web/api/.
data/

# Python backend and tooling. The static build has no server side.
server/
tools/
pyproject.toml

# Docs that are not served
THIRD_PARTY.md
